  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ShaderSources is a static utility class that centralizes and registers all file paths for vertex and fragment shaders used across the application. It acts as a single source of truth for asset loading within the rendering pipeline. It provides two read-only maps, 'frag' and 'vertex', mapping descriptive shader names to their specific asset locations. This abstraction prevents hardcoding shader paths throughout the codebase, significantly improving maintainability."
  },
